(vec/add vector & vectors) "The sum of the [x y] vectors, as floats. Every rodeo function that takes a point also takes a map of :x and :y."
(vec/sub a b) "a minus b."
(vec/scale v factor) "v with both parts multiplied by factor."
(vec/length v) "How long v is."
(vec/normalize v) "v made one unit long, pointing the same way; [0 0] stays [0 0]."
(vec/perpendicular v) "v turned a quarter turn clockwise, as y points down."
(vec/dot a b) "The dot product of a and b."
(vec/cross a b) "The z part of a crossed with b: positive when b is clockwise from a."
(vec/distance a b) "How far apart the points a and b are."
(vec/angle v) "The angle of v in radians, clockwise from pointing right, from -pi to pi."
(vec/from-angle radians (length)) "A vector pointing radians clockwise from right, one unit long or length long."
(vec/rotate v radians) "v turned clockwise by radians."
(vec/clamp-length v most) "v shortened to at most most long, keeping its direction."
(vec/reflect v normal) "v bounced off a surface facing normal, which should be one unit long."
(vec/lerp a b t) "The point t of the way from a to b."
(vec/move-toward from to step) "from moved step closer to to, stopping on it."
(vec/degrees radians) "radians in degrees."
(vec/radians degrees) "degrees in radians."
